  "title": "Spotify Reports Second Quarter 2026 Earnings",
  "summary": "Today, we announced our Second Quarter 2026 earnings, and with them a milestone no audio streaming service has ever reached: 300 million Premium Subscribers. In Q2, our revenue growth accelerated, gross margin hit an all-time record, and we continued to ship features that deepen how fans discover, create, and connect on Spotify, while supporting artists,...",
